01:00:28.770 --> 01:00:32.130
And so we're able to
leverage the processing

01:00:32.130 --> 01:00:34.658
power of microorganisms
to produce our pigments.

01:00:34.658 --> 01:00:36.450
We've developed an
environmentally-friendly

01:00:36.450 --> 01:00:39.440
