01:33:14.310 --> 01:33:16.290
The 15K Creative
Arts Competition

01:33:16.290 --> 01:33:19.660
is for student
arts-focused businesses.

01:33:19.660 --> 01:33:22.200
So this is an area of
arts entrepreneurship

01:33:22.200 --> 01:33:25.920
that tends to mix the
Arts, and technology,

01:33:25.920 --> 01:33:28.135
and sciences up in
very interesting ways.

01:33:28.135 --> 01:33:29.760
Well, first of all,
I think MIT is just

01:33:29.760 --> 01:33:31.480
an incredibly creative place.

01:33:31.480 --> 01:33:34.080
There are so many
creative people here.

01:33:34.080 --> 01:33:38.250
I remember as a student just
thinking that, in a sense,

01:33:38.250 --> 01:33:40.140
art was everywhere.

01:33:40.140 --> 01:33:43.250
As a woman of color and as
a citizen on this Earth,

01:33:43.250 --> 01:33:45.060
I have some concerns.

01:33:45.060 --> 01:33:47.400
The parameter for
applying is really just

01:33:47.400 --> 01:33:50.730
to have an idea, even if
you're a solo entrepreneur.

01:33:50.730 --> 01:33:53.730
Because after you apply, there
are six weeks of mentoring

01:33:53.730 --> 01:33:57.660
and networking and workshops,
so that at the end of April

01:33:57.660 --> 01:34:00.948
at Live Pitch Day, you have
a strong business plan,

01:34:00.948 --> 01:34:02.490
you've considered
your market, you've

01:34:02.490 --> 01:34:05.365
considered your path to market,
you've considered your team,

01:34:05.365 --> 01:34:07.490
your value prop, and all
of the other things that's

01:34:07.490 --> 01:34:09.270
an important business has.

01:34:09.270 --> 01:34:13.940
The mentorship component really
helped us rethink some of our--

01:34:13.940 --> 01:34:16.110
the way we're presenting
our ideas, and even

01:34:16.110 --> 01:34:17.735
some of our business
model questions.

01:34:17.735 --> 01:34:19.120
So that was really helpful.

01:34:19.120 --> 01:34:22.290
I think the most important
thing is not the result.

01:34:22.290 --> 01:34:26.000
It's the process
during the competition.

01:34:26.000 --> 01:34:28.550
We're seeing a lot of
technological disruption

01:34:28.550 --> 01:34:32.000
in the Arts, and MIT being
a leader in technology,

01:34:32.000 --> 01:34:34.730
it just needs to be
involved in supporting

01:34:34.730 --> 01:34:36.872
the Arts from a
technological perspective.

01:34:46.220 --> 01:34:48.090
Great, thank you, Dana.

