01:35:31.510 --> 01:35:37.350
but Teach to Learn is a
global arts education network.

01:35:37.350 --> 01:35:38.820
And really the
core of what we do

01:35:38.820 --> 01:35:42.900
is using music as a
foundation for building

01:35:42.900 --> 01:35:46.320
personal relationships and
a truly online community.

01:35:46.320 --> 01:35:48.540
And our goal is really
to empower people

01:35:48.540 --> 01:35:51.586
to share what they
know and love.

