01:58:54.320 --> 01:58:57.010
Thank you so, so much.

01:58:57.010 --> 01:58:58.310
Thank you.

01:58:58.310 --> 01:59:00.840
Congratulations!

01:59:00.840 --> 01:59:01.800
Thank you very much.

01:59:01.800 --> 01:59:02.300
Thank you.

01:59:02.300 --> 01:59:02.990
Congratulations!

01:59:02.990 --> 01:59:04.880
Congratulations,
great work everyone!

01:59:04.880 --> 01:59:05.810
Congratulations.

01:59:05.810 --> 01:59:06.710
Congratulations.

01:59:06.710 --> 01:59:08.560
Well done.

